{title: Tu Banja Gali Benaras Ki}
{artist: Asit Tripathy Asees Kaur}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Tu banja gali [Am]Benaras ki,        Main [C]shaam talak bhat [G]ku tujhme
[G]Tu banja gali [Am]Benaras ki,        Main [C]shaam talak bhat [G]ku tujhme
[C]Teri baatein chatpat [G]chaat si hai,        [C]Teri aankhen Ganga [G]ghaat si hain
Main [D]ghaat kinare [Em]so jaaun... [C],        Phir [D]subha subha [G]jaagun tujhme
[G]Tu banja gali [Am]Benaras ki,        Main [C]shaam talak bhat [G]ku tujhme
[G]Tujhe shehar ghumaaun der talak,        Yunhi [Am]daayen baayen [G]muda karun
[G]Tujhe scooter pe bitha ke main,        Tere [Am]saath hawa mein [G]udaa karun
Meri [C]kamar pe tera [G]haath aaye,        To [C]bulb ragon mein [G]jal jaaye
Meri [D]saans mein teri [Em]saans chale.. [C],        Main [D]dil ki tarah dhad [G]ku tujhme
[G]Tu banja gali [Am]Benaras ki,        Main [C]shaam talak bhat [G]ku tujhme
[G]Har sunday main Sangam Talkies mein,        Tujhe [Am]film dikhaaun [G]night show
[G]Filmon ki tarah ik din yun ho,        Ban [Am]jaau main [G]tera hero
Tera [C]dil behlaaun [G]dance karun,        Main [C]yunhi tujhe [G]romance karun
Tere [D]dil me rahu khushi [Em]yo ki tarah.. [C],        Tu [D]hasey to main jhal [G]kun tujhme
[G]Tu banja gali [Am]Benaras ki,        Main [C]shaam talak bhat [G]ku tujhme
